\item[S2] Walter K. Hayman and Edward F. Lingham, \emph{Research Problems in Function Theory}, arXiv:1809.07200, 2018. Problem 3.32, its complete Update 3.32, and the relevant chapter notation. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1809.07200}.
